# GitHub CODEOWNERS
# https://docs.github.com/en/repositories/managing-your-repositorys-settings-and-features/customizing-your-repository/about-code-owners
#
# This file defines automatic code owners for files in this repository.
# When a pull request is opened, GitHub will automatically request review from the code owners.
# A code owner can be a user (@username) or a team (@org/team-name).
#
# This is a Template for a CODEOWNERS file.
#
# Syntax:
# - Lines starting with # are comments
# - Each line specifies a path pattern and one or more owners
# - Patterns use gitignore syntax: https://git-scm.com/docs/gitignore
# - The last matching pattern takes precedence
# - Examples: Src/Api/* or **/*.Tests.cs
#
# Path Pattern Notation:
# *.ext          - Match files with specific extension
# */             - Match directories
# **/             - Match files in any subdirectory (recursive)
# Src/            - Match all files under Src directory

# Default owners for the repository
*                                     @anthonynoelw

# API Layer
Src/Api/**                             @anthonynoelw
Src/Api/Controllers/**                 @anthonynoelw
Src/Api/Middleware/**                  @anthonynoelw
Src/Api/Extensions/**                  @anthonynoelw

# Agent Layer
